    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present this fine detached dormer bungalow, set on a generous half-acre plot just a short drive from the vibrant town of Midleton. Built in 2001 and beautifully maintained throughout, this spacious 5-bedroom home offers a rare combination of privacy, comfort and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nA tree-lined driveway sets the tone on approach, opening onto grounds of approximately 0.5 acres that have been thoughtfully landscaped and carefully nurtured over the years. To the front, a boundary wall encloses a cobble-locked forecourt with ample parking for several vehicles, while a private patio to the rear offers an ideal spot for relaxing or entertaining.\r\nConveniently positioned on the outskirts of Midleton, the property enjoys easy access to the Cork–Waterford N25 and Cork International Airport, with excellent connections to surrounding towns and cities. Families are well served by a choice of highly regarded schools, and the shops, restaurants, bars and amenities of Midleton are all close at hand.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes: Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining, Sun Room, Utility Room, Guest WC, 5 Bedrooms (2 Ensuite) & Family Bathroom.\r\n(circa 2,230 sq.ft.)\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €495,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: \t\tWelcoming, hallway with tiled flooring.\t\r\n\r\nLarge Sitting Room:\tDouble doors, bay window, open Fire, solid timber floor. \r\n\r\nKitchen/\r\nDining Area: \tFully fitted white kitchen with multipurpose, fitted stove. Double doors, Solid timber flooring & tiled splashback. \r\n\r\nSunroom:\tRear aspect room, Tiled floor, door to rear.\r\n\t\r\nUtility: \tFloor to ceiling units & plumbed for washing machine/dryer.\r\n\r\nGuest Toilet:\tW.C., w.h.b & tiled flooring. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:\tFront aspect, spacious ground floor bedroom, bay window with solid wood flooring & walk-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nEnsuite:\t\tTiled floor, shower & sink area. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2/Office: \t\tRear aspect room with solid timber flooring\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\t\t\t \t\r\nBedroom 3: \tLarge bedroom with dual aspect windows with stunning countryside views.  timber flooring.  \r\n\r\nEn suite: \t\tWC, WHB, Shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\t\tLarge front aspect room, light filled, timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5: \t\tDual aspect facing windows, wood floor, built ins.\r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\tW.C. and w.h.b. Jacuzzi styled bath, overhead shower, fully tiled. \r\n\r\nSale to include:\tCurtains, Carpets, Blinds, Kitchen appliances, free standing fridge freeze, 1 x free standing wardrobe, sitting room unit. \r\n \r\nOutside:\t\t\tTo the front of the property, there is a boundary wall leading to a cobble driveway providing ample off-street parking.   To the rear there is a Double garage fully powered.  There are lawned front & rear gardens situated on 0.5 acres giving stunning countryside views from the property.\r\n\r\nServices: \r\n•\tMains water \r\n•\tBio Cycle unit\r\n•\tWater filtration system\r\n•\tO.F.C.Heating"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBuilt in 2001\r\n•\tDouble garage with electric up and doors, 3 windows, sink unit, radiator & upstairs with stira. \r\n•\tMains water Bio Cycle\r\n•\tFitted alarm- Phonewatch\r\n•\tOutdoor sockets, tap & lighting.\r\n•\tSuperb location, within a 5 minute drive of Midleton town.\r\n•\tBER: C1 \tBER Number: \t106735731\r\n•\tEircode P25 HF21"
